<tei:p><tei:pb n="752" ed="1949 lifecycle" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n776_medium.jpg"/><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:lifecycle/text/pidyon_exchange"/>This instead of that, this in exchange for that, this is given up for that. May this child enjoy a life of Torah and godliness. Even as he has attained to redemption, so may he attain to the Torah, to the marriage canopy and to a life of good deeds. Amen.<tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
